__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"ANSWER_ALTS",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return n}});var o=r(d[0]);const t=o=>o.sponsorName??o.coordinatorName,n={'craving-now':[o=>`Okay, I\u2019m right here. Cravings feel huge, but they don\u2019t last. Try stepping away from where you are, grabbing some water, or riding it out with me for 20 minutes. ${o.sponsorName?`${o.sponsorName} said you can call any time, too.`:'Your coordinator can help too.'} What\u2019s happening right now?`,o=>`Thank you for telling me. That urge is real, and it will pass. Moving to a different spot, sipping some water, or waiting it out for 20 minutes can all help. ${o.sponsorName?`And ${o.sponsorName} said to call any time.`:'Your coordinator can help too.'} What\u2019s going on?`],'craving-length':['Think of a craving like a wave. It rises, it crests, and then it rolls back out. Most people find one fades in about 20 to 30 minutes if they hang on. And the longer you\u2019re in recovery, the less often they tend to show up.'],'meeting-what':['A meeting usually runs about an hour. Someone opens with a short reading, then people take turns talking about their own recovery. You\u2019re welcome to just listen. No one has to speak, and it doesn\u2019t cost anything. Showing up a few minutes early is an easy way to get to know people.'],'meeting-talk':['Nope, not at all. You can just say "I\u2019ll listen today" or "pass." Plenty of people listen for weeks before they share.'],'meeting-types':['AA is mainly about alcohol, and NA is about drugs. They both use the 12 steps and sponsors. SMART Recovery skips the steps and uses practical tools. Celebrate Recovery is built on faith, and Recovery Dharma uses meditation. Feel free to try a few and stick with the ones that fit.'],'sponsor-find':['Keep going to the same meetings for a bit, and notice someone whose recovery you look up to. Then you can simply ask, "Would you be my sponsor?" People ask all the time, and it\u2019s fine if the first person says no. Once you find someone, you can add them in LifeCircle.'],sleep:['Oh, sleepless nights are rough. Lots of people struggle with sleep early in recovery, and it usually eases up over time. Waking at the same time each day can help, so can setting the phone aside before bed and cutting back on caffeine after lunch. If it keeps going, your counselor or prescriber can help too.','Not sleeping wears you down, I know. It\u2019s really common early in recovery, and it tends to get better. A steady wake-up time, no phone right before bed, and less caffeine after lunch can all make a difference. If it doesn\u2019t let up, your counselor or prescriber can help too.'],'feelings-normal':[o=>`It\u2019s completely normal. Recovery comes with big highs and lows, and you\u2019re far from the only one riding them. Sharing it really helps, and ${t(o)} and your counselor are great people to talk to. How have things been feeling for you lately?`],lonely:['I\u2019m sorry. Loneliness is so heavy, and lots of people in recovery feel it, especially at the start. Reaching out to just one person today can help, even with a quick text. Meetings are a good spot to find people who understand, too. And I\u2019m here with you now.','That\u2019s such a hard feeling, and you\u2019re not the only one who has it. So many people feel it early in recovery. Even one short message to someone today can help. Meetings are full of people who get it, too. I\u2019m right here with you.'],'housing-tonight':[o=>`Oh, I\u2019m sorry, that\u2019s a lot. ${o.coordinatorName} can help with housing, so calling her now is a great first step. You can also call 211 any time for local shelter and housing help.`],food:[o=>`Let\u2019s find you something to eat. 211 can point you to food banks and free meals nearby, and ${o.coordinatorName} can help you sign up for food benefits like SNAP.`],bills:[o=>`Money worries weigh a lot, and you don\u2019t have to carry them alone. ${o.coordinatorName} can go over your options with you, and 211 can connect you with local help for rent and bills.`],'meeting-dont-want':[o=>`That makes sense, and it\u2019s okay to feel that way. Lots of people find the days they least want to go are the days it helps the most. You don\u2019t have to say a word. You can sit in the back and just listen. If meetings aren\u2019t working for you, try a new one, or talk with ${t(o)} about what might suit you better.`],'relapse-what':[o=>`A relapse doesn\u2019t wipe out your recovery, and it doesn\u2019t make you a failure. If it ever happens, the most important thing is to reach out right away, like to ${t(o)}, so you get support quickly. Every house has its own rules about use, so ${o.coordinatorName} can tell you what it would mean for your housing.`],dreams:['Oh, those dreams can really shake you. Using dreams are super common in recovery, especially that first year. They don\u2019t mean you want to use, and they don\u2019t mean anything\u2019s wrong with you. When you wake up, some water and a few slow breaths can help, and so can talking about it with someone.'],'self-worth':[t=>`Oh, ${t.name}, I\u2019m sorry you feel that way about yourself. That voice gets loud in recovery, but it\u2019s not telling the truth. You\u2019re here, you\u2019re trying, and that matters. Here\u2019s one to hold onto: \u201c${(0,o.affirmation)('worth')}\u201d Who in your LifeCircle could you talk to today?`],counseling:[o=>`I\u2019m so glad you want that. Talking with a real person can help a lot. ${o.coordinatorName} can get you set up with counseling, and ${o.sponsorName??'anyone in your LifeCircle'} is only a call away right now.`],win:[o=>`Yay, ${o.name}! \ud83c\udf89 That\u2019s a big deal, and you worked for it. Want to save it in LifeEvent so you can look back on it on the hard days?`,o=>`Way to go, ${o.name}! \ud83c\udf89 Moments like this deserve to be celebrated. Want to save it in LifeEvent so you can come back to it on tougher days?`],'kids-family':[o=>`Family can be one of the toughest parts of recovery, and one of the things that matters most. Do you want to tell me what\u2019s happening? ${o.coordinatorName} can help with things like visits and custody, and ${o.sponsorName??'your LifeCircle'} has probably been through something like it.`],breakup:[o=>`Oh, I\u2019m so sorry. Breakups really hurt, and early in recovery they can hit even harder. Please don\u2019t spend tonight alone with it. Could you call ${o.sponsorName??'someone in your LifeCircle'}? It\u2019s okay to feel this. Do you want to tell me what happened?`],'job-find':[o=>`That\u2019s a great step to take! ${o.coordinatorName} can help you build a resume, practice interviewing, and find employers who hire people in recovery. You can also add it to LifeGoals under Career to keep track of how it\u2019s going.`],'job-hard':[o=>`Oh no, I\u2019m sorry. Stress at work is real, and it can be a trigger. What\u2019s going on? If you lost your job, that doesn\u2019t define you, and ${o.coordinatorName} can help figure out what\u2019s next. Today\u2019s a good day to lean on ${o.sponsorName??'your LifeCircle'}.`],court:[o=>`Court and probation can be a lot to keep up with. You don\u2019t have to hold it all in your head. Add each date to your Calendar and I\u2019ll remind you, and let ${o.coordinatorName} know. She can often help with letters or proof of treatment, and Check In/Out keeps a record of the meetings and groups you went to.`],ua:[o=>`I can tell that\u2019s on your mind. If you\u2019re nervous about a test, being honest with ${o.coordinatorName} before the result comes back really helps. Making a plan together is so much easier. And if you used, that\u2019s a slip, not the end of your recovery.`],school:[o=>`What a great goal! You can add it to LifeGoals under Education. ${o.coordinatorName} can help you find GED classes or a school program, and help with things like financial aid.`],ride:[o=>`Let\u2019s get you there. ${o.coordinatorName} can help with rides and bus passes. For medical appointments, Medicaid often covers a free ride if you book ahead, so ask ${o.coordinatorName} to set it up. Someone in your LifeCircle might be able to drive you, too.`],'id-docs':[o=>`Ugh, that\u2019s a hassle, but you can get it sorted, and you don\u2019t have to do it alone. ${o.coordinatorName} can help you get your birth certificate, social security card, and state ID. Bring anything you have with your name on it.`],roommates:[o=>`Sharing a house can be tough sometimes, especially in recovery. Do you want to tell me what\u2019s happening? Your house manager can help work things out in the house, and ${o.coordinatorName} is there to talk about your housing.`],party:[o=>`Parties can be hard in recovery, especially with drinking or using around. If you go, it helps to bring a sober friend, hold your own drink, and have a way to leave. Keep your phone handy to call ${o.sponsorName??'someone in your LifeCircle'}, and check your house rules too. And it\u2019s completely fine to sit this one out.`],grief:[o=>`Oh, ${o.name}, I\u2019m so sorry. Losing someone is so heavy, and grief can stir up cravings, so please don\u2019t carry it by yourself. Let ${t(o)} know what happened, and lean on your LifeCircle. Would you like to tell me about them?`],'sponsor-trouble':['Oh, that\u2019s rough. Sponsors are human too, and things can get tense. Talking it out when you\u2019re both calm can help. And if it really doesn\u2019t feel right, it\u2019s okay to find a new sponsor. Lots of people do, and it doesn\u2019t mean you did anything wrong.'],'health-question':[o=>`I can\u2019t tell what\u2019s going on with your health. Only a doctor or counselor can, after really talking with you. If something feels off, ${o.coordinatorName} can help you get an appointment. Do you want to tell me what\u2019s been happening?`],motivation:[o=>`${o.cleanDays?`${o.cleanDays} days ago, today was just a hope. You made it happen, one day at a time.`:'Every day you show up is a day you made happen.'} You don\u2019t have to do all of it today. Just today. I\u2019m really proud of you, ${o.name}.`],'what-to-do':['Ooh, let\u2019s see. You could go for a walk, catch a meeting, call someone in your LifeCircle, or make something you like to eat. Working on a goal or writing in LifeEvent is nice too. Boredom can be a trigger, so even a small plan helps. What sounds fun to you?'],'zoey-chat':['Aw, thanks for asking! \ud83d\ude04 I\u2019m just an app, so no favorite color or snacks for me, but I really enjoy talking with you. What\u2019s on your mind?'],'zoey-sick':['Nope, no illness here. I\u2019m not a person, so I can\u2019t catch anything, but I really want you to feel good. How are you doing?'],'zoey-name':['I\u2019m Zoey! I\u2019m the helper in Life Works. I\u2019m not a real person, so no birthday cake for me, but I\u2019m here any time, day or night.'],'zoey-can-do':['I can help with questions about cravings, meetings, sponsors, sleep, housing, food, work, court, and Life Works. We can do check-ins together, I can tell you what\u2019s on your calendar, and I can help you reach your LifeCircle. I\u2019m not a counselor, but I\u2019m always happy to talk.']}},430,[426]);
__d(function(g,_r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"HOTLINES",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return o}}),e.validateReply=function(n,r=['988','911','211','741741',...Object.values(o),...(0,s.regionNumbers)()]){const c=t.filter(s=>s.test(n)).map(s=>`blocked: ${s.source}`),l=n.match(/\(?\d{3}\)?[-.\s]?\d{3}[-.\s]?\d{4}|\b\d{3,}\b/g)??[];for(const s of l){const o=s.replace(/\D/g,'');/^(19|20)\d\d$/.test(o)||r.includes(o)||c.push(`unknown number: ${s}`)}return{ok:0===c.length,reasons:c}};var s=_r(d[0]);const o={samhsa:'18006624357',dv:'18007997233',rainn:'18006564673',neverUseAlone:'18004843731'},t=[/\byou (have|might have|may have|probably have|sound like you have|are|seem) (a |an )?(\w+ )?(disorder|condition|depression|depressed|anxiety|bipolar|ptsd|addiction|alcoholic|addict|illness|disease)\b/i,/\b(diagnos\w*|disorder|symptom\w*|bipolar|ptsd|schizo\w*|psychosis|clinical depression)\b/i,/\b(take|stop taking|increase|decrease|skip|double|cut) (your|the|a|more|less)\b.*\b(med\w*|pill\w*|dose\w*)\b/i,/\b\d+\s?mg\b/i,/\b(i am|i'm|as) (a|your) (therapist|counsell?or|doctor|nurse|psychologist|psychiatrist)\b/i]},431,[346]);
__d(function(g,r,i,_a,m,_e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(_e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(_e,"BETA",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return a}}),_e.betaKey=o,_e.findBeta=n,_e.betaReply=function(e,a){const o=n(e);if(!o)return null;return{kind:'answer',answer:{id:o.id,topic:o.topic,q:o.said[0],keys:[],text:e=>s(o.reply,e)},text:s(o.reply,a),alts:o.alts.map(e=>s(e,a)),actions:[],alternatives:[]}};var e=r(d[0]);const a=[{id:"beta-001",said:["A customer at work put me down in a very angry manner causing a small breakdown and tears"],reply:"That sounds pretty serious, have you talked to anyone in your LifeCircle about this?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Anger"},{id:"beta-002",said:["angry"],reply:"I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel this way?",alts:["Anger can lead to behaviors you may regret. Have you called anyone in your LifeCircle?","Anger can lead to behaviors you may regret. Have you called your counselor?","Anger can lead to behaviors you may regret. Have you been focused on your recovery?","Anger is one of the first signs of relapse. Have you called your counselor?","Anger is an early sign of relapse. Have you been focused on your recovery?"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Anger"},{id:"beta-003",said:["Because I'm feeling pretty angry"],reply:"I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel this way?",alts:["Anger is one of the first signs of relapse. Have you called your counselor?","Anger can lead to behaviors you may regret. Have you been focused on your recovery?"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Anger"},{id:"beta-004",said:["Annoyed"],reply:"I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel this way?",alts:["Feeling annoyed can lead to behaviors you may regret. Have you called anyone in your LifeCircle?","Feeling annoyed can be an early sign of relapse. Have you called anyone in your LifeCircle?","I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel annoyed?"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Annoyed"},{id:"beta-005",said:["Because people are so stupid and annoying"],reply:"I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel this way?",alts:["I agree, it sure feels that way some times!!! Have you talked with someone in your LifeCircle?"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Annoyed"},{id:"beta-006",said:["Because people here are really annoying and stupid"],reply:"I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel this way?",alts:["Why do you think some people act that way? All the more reason to stay focused on your recovery!"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Annoyed"},{id:"beta-007",said:["Anxious"],reply:"Anxiety can be very difficult, why do you think you are feeling anxious? Have you consulted with your counselor?",alts:["Anxiety can be caused by many things. If this anxiety is interfering with daily functioning then I would suggest you contact your doctor.","Anxiety can be caused by many different things. Have you contacted your doctor?","Anxiety can be very difficult, why do you think you are feeling anxious? Have you contacted your doctor?","Anxiety can be caused by many things. If this anxiety is causing fear or depression then I would suggest you contact your doctor.","Anxiety can be caused by many different things. Have you talked with anyone in your LifeCircle?"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Anxiety"},{id:"beta-008",said:["How can I change my attitude"],reply:"When it comes to changing your attitude, you need to do an honest and in-depth self-evaluation so you could point out exactly which of your traits need to be improved or totally changed.",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Attitude"},{id:"beta-009",said:["Call a friend"],reply:"{name}, I am glad to hear you are reaching out to those who can help you.",alts:["{name}, I am glad to hear you are reaching out to friends. Healthy relationships are important!"],topic:"Family and friends",category:"Command"},{id:"beta-010",said:["Call my sponsor"],reply:"{name}, I am glad to hear you are reaching out to those who can help you.",alts:["{name}, I am glad to hear you are reaching out to those who can help you. Healthy relationships are important!"],topic:"Family and friends",category:"Command"},{id:"beta-011",said:["....? How should one view the death of a friend or loved one"],reply:"{name}, grief can take a serious toll, even on the most resilient individuals. During the grieving process, it\u2019s important to experience and express emotions in order to eventually heal and get on with life.",alts:["The grieving process is a difficult one. There are five stages of grief, so be patient it may take some time. It is important to work thru your emotions and remember your counselor or LifeCircle members are there to help you."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Death"},{id:"beta-012",said:["How should I handle the death of a friend or loved one"],reply:"{name}, grief can take a serious toll, even on the most resilient individuals. During the grieving process, it\u2019s important to experience and express emotions in order to eventually heal and get on with life.",alts:["The grieving process is a difficult one. There are five stages of grief, so be patient it may take some time. Remember your counselor or LifeCircle are there to help you."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Death"},{id:"beta-013",said:["Drink more beer"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-014",said:["Drunk"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-015",said:["How much alcohol can I drink"],reply:"When you\u2019re sober, it\u2019s so easy to tell yourself you\u2019ll have just one drink. Or if you\u2019re trying to be honest with yourself, you say you\u2019ll stop at two; maybe two is enough to feel it, but not enough to have any consequences. But what happens when you finish that second drink?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-016",said:["I need a beer"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-017",said:["I need a cocktail"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-018",said:["I need a drink"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-019",said:["I need to drink alcohol"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-020",said:["I really want to drink alcohol"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-021",said:["I want a drink"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-022",said:["I want a shot of vodka"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-023",said:["I want to get drunk"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-024",said:["I want to go drink"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drinking"},{id:"beta-025",said:["Are drugs good for you"],reply:"Even occasional or experimental drug use can be dangerous. Why are you asking?",alts:["No...Drugs can cause serious health issues or even death\u2026 Why do you want to go there?"],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drugs"},{id:"beta-026",said:["Do you know what drugs are"],reply:"Yes. Why are you asking?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drugs"},{id:"beta-027",said:["Do you know where I can get drugs"],reply:"Do you really want to use drugs again, you have worked so hard to get where you are today.",alts:["Do you really think using drugs again is a good choice? Have you called your sponsor or counselor?"],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drugs"},{id:"beta-028",said:["I want to Do drugs"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drugs"},{id:"beta-029",said:["Take some more meth"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Drugs"},{id:"beta-030",said:["Eat cookies"],reply:"The essence of recovery is changing negative behaviors into positive ones. Good nutrition, relaxation, and exercise all play an important role in successful change. Learning to make healthy food choices is important to achieving a healthy lifestyle.",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Eating"},{id:"beta-031",said:["find a new job"],reply:"I am not sure I can help you with that but would love to help you stay in recovery. How can I help you do that?",alts:["I'm sure the Department of Labor can help with that, they have a great deal of resources."],topic:"Work, school and court",category:"Employment"},{id:"beta-032",said:["Get a job"],reply:"Are you looking for a job?",alts:["Have you tried the Department of Labor? I know they have a great deal of resources."],topic:"Work, school and court",category:"Employment"},{id:"beta-033",said:["How are you supposed to have a good day at work no no matter how good you do or how bad you do you're going to get fired"],reply:"That sounds pretty serious, have you talked to anyone in your LifeCircle about this?",alts:[],topic:"Work, school and court",category:"Employment"},{id:"beta-034",said:["I can work harder"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"Work, school and court",category:"Employment"},{id:"beta-035",said:["Stop thinking about work"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"Work, school and court",category:"Employment"},{id:"beta-036",said:["Can you help me how to fix my being tired"],reply:"Why do you think you are feeling tired?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Energy"},{id:"beta-037",said:["How can I gain more energy"],reply:"A good night\u2019s sleep, exercise and a well balanced diet are important for having more energy.",alts:["A well balanced diet is important to maintain a good energy level.","A healthy diet with lots of vegetables and food low in fat & sugar are very good ways to maintain your energy level.","Being well rested along with a well balanced diet will help maintain good energy levels."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Energy"},{id:"beta-038",said:["I'm a little tired Zoe Zoe"],reply:"Why do you think you are feeling tired?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Energy"},{id:"beta-039",said:["I've been very dizzy and tired"],reply:"Why do you think you are feeling tired?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Energy"},{id:"beta-040",said:["Kinda tired"],reply:"Why do you think you are feeling tired?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Energy"},{id:"beta-041",said:["Super tired"],reply:"Why do you think you are feeling tired?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Energy"},{id:"beta-042",said:["Tired"],reply:"Why do you think you are feeling tired?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Energy"},{id:"beta-043",said:["Well I'm tired and I didn't get a weekend I worked all weekend so I just want to sit around the house and veg"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Energy"},{id:"beta-044",said:["Go for a walk"],reply:"That is great, {name}. Exercise has been shown to alleviate both physical and psychological stress.",alts:["That\u2019s a good choice, {name}. Fresh air and exercise are a good way to clear your thoughts and continue on a healthy path!"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Exercise"},{id:"beta-045",said:["go running"],reply:"That is great! When you exercise, your body releases endorphins which create a natural high.",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Exercise"},{id:"beta-046",said:["Going for a walk"],reply:"That is great! When you exercise, your body releases endorphins which create a natural high.",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Exercise"},{id:"beta-047",said:["I can take more walks"],reply:"That is great, {name}. Exercise has been shown to alleviate both physical and psychological stress.",alts:["That's a good choice, {name}. Exercise and a healthy diet are very beneficial and have been known to increase energy!"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Exercise"},{id:"beta-048",said:["I think I can take more walks"],reply:"That is great, {name}. Exercise has been shown to alleviate both physical and psychological stress.",alts:["That's a good choice, {name}. Exercise and a healthy diet are very beneficial, physically and psychologically."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Exercise"},{id:"beta-049",said:["Amen"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-050",said:["By praying"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-051",said:["Go to church"],reply:"Is going to church something that helps you grow and stay focused on what is important?",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-052",said:["God is good"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-053",said:["Have faith in Christ that everything will go as well"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-054",said:["I can turn my life to Christ"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-055",said:["I could turn it over to God and I'm glad to see that your voice activated system is working"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-056",said:["Just pray for the best and trust God will do what needs done"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-057",said:["Keep a positive attitude and keep praying"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-058",said:["Maybe just continue to pray and think God"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-059",said:["Pray"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-060",said:["pray pray pray"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-061",said:["Say a prayer Take a hot bath and go to bed"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-062",said:["Surrendering is about giving it to Christ letting go and giving up on control"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Faith / Prayer"},{id:"beta-063",said:["Because were set out to do the job and it's not the way it's showing on print it's just frustrating Zoe that's all"],reply:"I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel this way?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Frustration"},{id:"beta-064",said:["Frustrated"],reply:"I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel this way?",alts:["Frustration is an early sign of relapse\u2026 Has anything in particular triggered this feeling today? Have you called anyone in your LifeCircle?"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Frustration"},{id:"beta-065",said:["I am frustrated"],reply:"That sounds pretty serious, can you tell me more about why you are feeling this way?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Frustration"},{id:"beta-066",said:["I am very frustrated with my work situation! I feel irritated and taken advantage of"],reply:"Have you talked with anyone from your LifeCircle about this issue?",alts:["Work situations can often be challenging to deal with. NO ONE likes to be taken advantage of. Have you called anyone in your LifeCircle?","Work situations can often be challenging to deal with. NO ONE likes to be taken advantage of. Have you called your sponsor?"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Frustration"},{id:"beta-067",said:["Apartments for rent that take sex offenders"],reply:"I am not sure I can help you with that but would love to help you stay in recovery. How can I help you do that?",alts:[],topic:"Housing, food and money",category:"Housing (sex offense record)"},{id:"beta-068",said:["Find an apartment that rents the sex offenders"],reply:"Have you talked to your friends and family about your needs?",alts:[],topic:"Housing, food and money",category:"Housing (sex offense record)"},{id:"beta-069",said:["Help me find an apartment that sex offenders can live in"],reply:"I'm sure your counselor has more helpful information for your local area.",alts:["I am not sure I can help you with that but would love to help you stay in recovery. How can I help you do that?","Have you consulted with a professional? I'm sure they have more specifics for your local area."],topic:"Housing, food and money",category:"Housing (sex offense record)"},{id:"beta-070",said:["I have a sexual battery felony can I move forward in my life with all my stipulations"],reply:"Keep working with your counselor and stay focused on your recovery and the 12 steps.",alts:["Working your recovery is very important\u2026 Have you contacted your sponsor?"],topic:"Housing, food and money",category:"Housing (sex offense record)"},{id:"beta-071",said:["Devalued"],reply:"That sounds pretty serious, can you tell me more about why you are feeling this way?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Lack of Self Worth"},{id:"beta-072",said:["Awful"],reply:"I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel this way?",alts:["Feeling awful can lead to behaviors you may regret. Have you called anyone in your LifeCircle?","Feeling awful can lead to behaviors you may regret. Have you called your counselor?"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Negative"},{id:"beta-073",said:["Bad"],reply:"I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel this way?",alts:["Have you called your counselor?","Have you talked with anyone in your LifeCircle?","Have you been focusing on your recovery?","Feeling bad can lead to behaviors you may regret. Have you called your counselor?","Feeling bad can lead to behaviors you may regret. Have you called any one in your LifeCircle?"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Negative"},{id:"beta-074",said:["Because life sucks"],reply:"I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel this way?",alts:["It sure feels that way some days, but staying focused on your recovery is the best way to navigate the things life throws at us."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Negative"},{id:"beta-075",said:["Anyone want to have dinner tonight?"],reply:"I am not sure I can help you with that but would love to help you stay in recovery. How can I help you do that?",alts:["You do know I am virtual, don't you? So I can't join you. Have you called anyone in your LifeCircle? I have heard that Italian food is very tasty, you might try that!","You do know I am virtual, don't you? So I can't join you. Have you called anyone in your LifeCircle? I have heard that Mexican food is very tasty, you might try that!"],topic:"Using Life Works",category:"Non-response"},{id:"beta-076",said:["Find a place for rent"],reply:"I am not sure I can help you with that but would love to help you stay in recovery. How can I help you do that?",alts:[],topic:"Using Life Works",category:"Non-response"},{id:"beta-077",said:["Find my phone"],reply:"Ha-ha, I lose my phone all the time.",alts:["Ok\u2026 remember the old adage\u2026 it will be in the last place you look."],topic:"Using Life Works",category:"Non-response"},{id:"beta-078",said:["Finish the movie I'm watching"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"Using Life Works",category:"Non-response"},{id:"beta-079",said:["Fine"],reply:"I am glad to hear you are doing well.",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Okay"},{id:"beta-080",said:["Fine thank u"],reply:"I am glad to hear you are doing well.",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Okay"},{id:"beta-081",said:["Fine thanks"],reply:"I am glad to hear you are doing well.",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Okay"},{id:"beta-082",said:["Awesome"],reply:"That\u2019s great to hear, what made it so awesome?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Positive"},{id:"beta-083",said:["Awesome as always"],reply:"That\u2019s great to hear, what made it so awesome?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Positive"},{id:"beta-084",said:["Do you know what cocaine is"],reply:"Yes. Why are you asking?",alts:[],topic:"Using Life Works",category:"Question"},{id:"beta-085",said:["Do you know what methamphetamines are"],reply:"Yes. Why are you asking?",alts:[],topic:"Using Life Works",category:"Question"},{id:"beta-086",said:["How does this help me recover"],reply:"Life Works keeps you connected with those who care about you the most and keeps you focused on the future. Life Works is designed to interrupt the old triggers and cues and replace them with new positive habits.",alts:[],topic:"Using Life Works",category:"Question"},{id:"beta-087",said:["How does this help my recovery"],reply:"Life Works keeps you connected with those who care about you the most and keeps you focused on the future. Life Works is designed to interrupt the old triggers and cues and replace them with new positive habits.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:"Recovery"},{id:"beta-088",said:["Depressed"],reply:"Have you talked to anyone about being depressed?",alts:["Depression can be caused by many different things. Have you talked with anyone in your LifeCircle?","Depression can be caused by many things. If this depression is interfering with daily functioning then I would suggest you contact your doctor.","Depression can be caused by many different things. Have you contacted your doctor?"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sadness / Depression"},{id:"beta-089",said:["Difficulty sorting thru life"],reply:"That sounds pretty serious, can you tell me more about why you are feeling this way?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sadness / Depression"},{id:"beta-090",said:["Get a good night sleep"],reply:"Why do you think you are not sleeping well?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-091",said:["Get a good nights sleep"],reply:"Why do you think you are not sleeping well?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-092",said:["Get a good nights sleepsmile while I'm sleeping"],reply:"Why do you think you are not sleeping well?",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-093",said:["I am struggling with exhaustion and not sure how to handle this. I'm having trouble focusing and I have a headache. I'm also feeling anxious which is why I think I can't sleep"],reply:"A good night\u2019s sleep, exercise and a well balanced diet are important for having more energy. Have you talked to your doctor or counselor about this?",alts:["A healthy diet with lots of vegetables and food low in fat & sugar along with a good night\u2019s sleep, are very good ways to ward off exhaustion.","Light exercise and a healthy diet and good sleeping habits are good ways to combat exhaustion. If this persists I would recommend contacting your doctor."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-094",said:["I can take a nap"],reply:"A good night\u2019s sleep, exercise and a well balanced diet are important for having more energy.",alts:["Taking a walk out in the fresh air can give you a boost of energy.","A low fat, low sugar diet with lots of veggies along with a good night\u2019s sleep can help maintain your energy level."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-095",said:["I didn't get enough sleep last night"],reply:"A good night\u2019s sleep, exercise and a well balanced diet are important for having more energy. Have you talked to your doctor or counselor about this?",alts:["I like taking a bath which is a good way to relax in order to get a better night sleep.","Often times, if I take a walk or do some light exercise during the day it helps with sleeping better. If this problem persists I would consider contacting your doctor.","Have you tried some relaxing activity before bed which would promote a better night\u2019s sleep? If this problem persists I would consider contacting your doctor.","A power nap can be helpful to get you through the day. Also, starting a relaxing bedtime routine often helps with a good night\u2019s sleep. If this problem persists I would consider contacting your doctor."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-096",said:["I think I'll take a nap"],reply:"A good night\u2019s sleep, exercise and a well balanced diet are important for having more energy.",alts:["A healthy snack and a power nap can get you through the day!","A power nap along with a healthy snack can help with your energy for the rest of the day."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-097",said:["I want to go to sleep"],reply:"Are you sleeping well? Have you tried light exercise during the day?",alts:["Have you tried playing soft music? That often helps me fall asleep.","I find reading a favorite book very relaxing.","Are you sleeping well? Have you tried reading or listening to calm, quiet music?","I find listening to soft background music such as nature sounds like falling rain, ocean waves or gentle wind will help me fall asleep.","Have you tried reading? It helps me fall asleep."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-098",said:["Lack of sleep"],reply:"A good night\u2019s sleep, exercise and a well balanced diet are important for having more energy. Have you talked to your doctor or counselor about this?",alts:["A power nap can be helpful to get you through the day. If this problem persists I would consider contacting your doctor."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-099",said:["No. I left work early and came home and took a nap"],reply:"A good night\u2019s sleep, exercise and a well balanced diet are important for having more energy.",alts:["A short 15 to 20 minute power nap can sometimes give you energy to get through the day."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-100",said:["Pray some more and go to sleep"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-101",said:["Sleep last night"],reply:"A good night\u2019s sleep, exercise and a well balanced diet are important for having more energy. Have you talked to your doctor or counselor about this?",alts:["Starting a relaxing bedtime routine often helps with a good night\u2019s sleep. If this problem persists I would consider contacting your doctor."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-102",said:["Sleep more"],reply:"A good night\u2019s sleep, exercise and a well balanced diet are important for having more energy. Have you talked to your doctor or counselor about this?",alts:["I find reading or some other quiet activity helps me sleep better. Have you tried reading before bed?","Have you tried starting a relaxing bedtime routine which often helps with a good night\u2019s sleep?"],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-103",said:["Take a nap"],reply:"A good night\u2019s sleep, exercise and a well balanced diet are important for having more energy.",alts:["Taking a walk outside in the fresh air can give you energy to get through the day."],topic:"Feelings and sleep",category:"Sleep"},{id:"beta-104",said:["Stay sober"],reply:"That is great, are you staying connected with those in your LifeCircle?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Sobriety"},{id:"beta-105",said:["Can I use drugs"],reply:"Drugs can be bad for you in lots of ways. Even occasional or experimental drug use can be dangerous. Why are you asking?",alts:["Do you really think that would not be a good choice? Drugs can cause serious health issues or even death\u2026"],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Using"},{id:"beta-106",said:["Don't you get it I said I feel like using you want me to click on faces what are you crazy"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Using"},{id:"beta-107",said:["I feel like using"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Using"},{id:"beta-108",said:["I want to use"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:["Urges like this can lead to choices you may regret\u2026 Have you been focusing on your recovery? Have you talked with your counselor?","Urges like this can lead to choices you may regret\u2026 Have you been focusing on your recovery? Have you talked to anyone in your LifeCircle?","Feeling this type of urge can lead to behaviors you may regret\u2026 All the more reason to stay focused on your recovery. Have you talked with your counselor?","Feeling this type of urge can lead to behaviors you may regret\u2026 All the more reason to stay focused on your recovery. Have you talked with anyone in your LifeCircle?"],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Using"},{id:"beta-109",said:["I want to use drugs"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Using"},{id:"beta-110",said:["OK I feel like using"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:["Feeling an urge like this can lead to choices you may regret\u2026 All the more reason to stay focused on your recovery. Have you talked with your counselor?","Feeling an urge like this can lead to choices you may regret\u2026 All the more reason to stay focused on your recovery. Have you talked with anyone in your LifeCircle?"],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Using"},{id:"beta-111",said:["Should I use drugs"],reply:"Do you really want to use drugs again, you have worked so hard to get where you are today.",alts:["Do you really think using drugs again is a good choice? Have you called anyone in your LifeCircle?","Would that really be a good choice? Drugs can cause serious health issues or even death\u2026 besides you've worked so hard on your recovery\u2026"],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Using"},{id:"beta-112",said:["Should I use drugs today"],reply:"Do you really want to use drugs again, you have worked so hard to get where you are today.",alts:["Drugs can cause serious health issues or even death\u2026 Have you considered calling your counselor or someone in your LifeCircle?"],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Using"},{id:"beta-113",said:["Smoke crack"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Using"},{id:"beta-114",said:["Can playing video games be addictive"],reply:"Similar to other addictions, individuals suffering from video game addiction use the virtual fantasy world to connect with real people through the Internet, as a substitution for real-life human connection, which they are unable to achieve normally. An addiction to video games or computer games should be treated in much the same way as any other addiction. Like other addicts, gamers often are trying to escape problems in their lives.",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Video Games"},{id:"beta-115",said:["can you remind me to play video games at 4:00"],reply:"For many people, video games can create triggers and get them off track. Are video games a trigger for you?",alts:["It is good to have an outlet like playing video games, as long as it is in balance with other activities and responsibilities."],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Video Games"},{id:"beta-116",said:["I think I am addicted to video games"],reply:"Similar to other addictions, individuals suffering from video game addiction use the virtual fantasy world to connect with real people through the Internet, as a substitution for real-life human connection, which they are unable to achieve normally. An addiction to video games or computer games should be treated in much the same way as any other addiction. Like other addicts, gamers often are trying to escape problems in their lives.",alts:[],topic:"Cravings and slips",category:"Video Games"},{id:"beta-117",said:["Ask me how I feel today"],reply:"How are you feeling today?",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-118",said:["Crappy day at work, and a good friend of mine is in the icu and it's not lookin good for him"],reply:"That sounds pretty serious, have you talked to anyone in your LifeCircle about this?",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-119",said:["Eating some food would help"],reply:"The essence of recovery is changing negative behaviors into positive ones. Good nutrition, relaxation, and exercise all play an important role in successful change. Learning to make healthy food choices is important to achieving a healthy lifestyle.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-120",said:["Enjoy my break from work"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-121",said:["Get along with my girlfriend and healthy communicate"],reply:"That is great, {name}! Good communication takes practice and effort.",alts:["Healthy communication is very important in any relationship, particularly intimate ones. Staying calm communicating is always a good start."],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-122",said:["Go home"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-123",said:["Go home and relax"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-124",said:["Go to work"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-125",said:["Gonna have dinner with the family and play with my son"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-126",said:["Great but I lost my phone"],reply:"Ha-ha, I lose my phone all the time.",alts:["You know the saying, \"it will be in the last place you look\"? Of course it is\u2026 because then you STOP looking. LOL!"],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-127",said:["How can I improve my day"],reply:"When it comes to changing your attitude, you need to do an honest and in-depth self-evaluation so you could point out exactly which of your traits need to be improved or totally changed.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-128",said:["How do I deal with being treated poorly by others"],reply:"It is important to set boundaries so people understand where you stand and that you matter. With some people, maintaining healthy boundaries requires a direct and clear-cut dialogue.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-129",said:["How do I fix my life after I screwed up so bad"],reply:"Stay focused on the future and keep making good choices and surround yourself with people who want to see you succeed.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-130",said:["How do I get over my guilt"],reply:"Ask for forgiveness and stay focused on your recovery and the 12 steps.",alts:["Working your recovery is very important\u2026 Have you contacted your sponsor?"],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-131",said:["How do I handle this"],reply:"Sounds like you need to talk with someone in your LifeCircle.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-132",said:["I am struggling"],reply:"What are you struggling with?",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-133",said:["I can spend more time outside I really love the sun"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-134",said:["I can spend more time with my new supportive friends"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-135",said:["I feel hungry"],reply:"The essence of recovery is changing negative behaviors into positive ones. Good nutrition, relaxation, and exercise all play an important role in successful change. Learning to make healthy food choices is important to achieving a healthy lifestyle.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-136",said:["I feel like running to the bar"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-137",said:["I need money"],reply:"I am not sure I can help you with that but would love to help you stay in recovery. How can I help you do that?",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-138",said:["I need to learn to be honest"],reply:"Have you talked with anyone from your LifeCircle about this issue?",alts:["Honesty is important. If we want others to be honest with us we need to be honest. Talking with someone in your LifeCircle can be helpful.","Honesty is the foundation for TRUST, you can't have one without the other!"],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-139",said:["I'd like you to tell me how to be content with life even when things aren't feeling great"],reply:"Stay focused on the future and keep making good choices and surround yourself with people who want to see you succeed.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-140",said:["Irritated"],reply:"I am sorry to hear that, {name}. What do you think is causing you to feel this way?",alts:["Feeling irritated can lead to behaviors you will regret\u2026 Has anything in particular triggered this feeling today? Have you called anyone in your LifeCircle?","Feeling irritated can lead to behaviors you may regret\u2026 Has anything in particular triggered this feeling today? Have you called your counselor?","Feeling irritated is an early sign of relapse\u2026 Have you been feeling this way often? Have you called anyone in your LifeCircle?","Feeling irritated can lead to behaviors you may regret\u2026 Do you feel this way often? Have you called your counselor?"],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-141",said:["My body hurts all the time. I don't know why"],reply:"I am not sure I can help you with that but would love to help you stay in recovery. How can I help you do that?",alts:["There could be many different reasons for that. Have you consulted with your doctor?","There could be many different reasons for that. Have you called your physician?"],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-142",said:["My friend and I can spend more time with my new supportive friend"],reply:"{name}, I am glad to hear you are reaching out to those who can help you.",alts:["{name}, I am glad to hear you are reaching out to those who can help you. Healthy relationships are important!"],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-143",said:["My menstrual cycle makes my iron low"],reply:"I am not sure I can help you with that but would love to help you stay in recovery. How can I help you do that?",alts:["There are supplements that could help. Have you consulted with your doctor?","There are supplements that could help with that. Have you called your physician?"],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-144",said:["My stomach has been upset I've been vomiting"],reply:"I am not sure I can help you with that but would love to help you stay in recovery. How can I help you do that?",alts:["There are medications that can help with that. Have you consulted with your physician?","There are medications that can help with that. Have you contacted your dotor?"],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-145",said:["Not wear a thong"],reply:"I am not sure I can help you with that but would love to help you stay in recovery. How can I help you do that?",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-146",said:["Plan dinner with a friend"],reply:"{name}, I am glad to hear you are reaching out to those who can help you.",alts:["{name}, I am glad to hear you are reaching out to friends. Healthy relationships are important!"],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-147",said:["Seeing old friends I used to use with is a trigger"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-148",said:["Seeing people I used to use with is a trigger"],reply:"I understand, {name}. During recovery, particularly the early months, urges or cravings to use alcohol or drugs are common. Have you talked to anyone about the urge?",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-149",said:["Smoke cigarettes"],reply:"The essence of recovery is changing negative behaviors into positive ones. Good nutrition, relaxation, and exercise all play an important role in successful change. Learning to make healthy food choices is important to achieving a healthy lifestyle.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-150",said:["Spend quality time with my wonderful husband"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-151",said:["Spend time with my daughter"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-152",said:["Stay busy and don't let little things get to me"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-153",said:["stay focused"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-154",said:["stay positive"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-155",said:["Surrendering"],reply:"Sounds like you have a close relationship with Jesus, I love to hear people pray, it makes me feel better too.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-156",said:["Take a hot bath and go to bed early"],reply:"A good night\u2019s sleep, exercise and a well balanced diet are important for having more energy.",alts:["Have you tried taking a bath? It is a great way to relax before going to bed.","A relaxing bath before bed is a great start to a good night\u2019s sleep."],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-157",said:["Take time to rest"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-158",said:["Today was a good day Zoe I spent time with my kids I had two days off from work it's a rarity but it was wonderful"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-159",said:["Work harder"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""},{id:"beta-160",said:["Work harder. Take time for myself"],reply:"That is great, finding a balance is an important part of recovery.",alts:[],topic:"My program",category:""}];function o(a){return(0,e.normalize)(a).replace(/[^a-z0-9 ]+/g,' ').replace(/\s+/g,' ').trim().replace(/^(?:ok|okay|well|um|so) /,'').replace(/(?: zoey?)+$/,'').trim()}const t=new Map;for(const e of a)for(const a of e.said)t.has(o(a))||t.set(o(a),e);function n(e){const a=o(e);return a?t.get(a)??null:null}const s=(e,a)=>e.replace(/\{name\}/g,a.name)},432,[282]);
